sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 失主/拾得者
    participant FE as 前端(Vue3)
    participant API as items.py(发布路由)
    participant PS as PublishService
    participant VS as VisionService(进程内单例)
    participant TS as TaggingService
    participant MS as MatchService
    participant MR as MatchRecord
    participant HO as HandoverService
    participant AU as AuditService
    U->>FE: 填写 类目/颜色/外观/特征/地点/描述/照片
    FE->>API: POST /lost-items 或 /found-items(FormData)
    API->>PS: PublishDTO(含 appearance/features/location)
    PS->>VS: predict(首图字节)
    VS-->>PS: {category_id,label,confidence}
    Note right of VS: 单路微调 YOLOv8n(best.pt,11类)；低置信/无检测 降级为"其他"类(id=12)
    PS->>TS: extract(标题,描述,视觉label,类目名)
    TS-->>PS: tags(颜色词+地点词+名词) + 镜像 appearance/features/location
    PS->>MR: 写 LostItem/FoundItem(tags,image_hash,appearance,features,location)
    PS->>MS: 反向主动匹配(候选:同类目 ∪ 共享名词 tag)
    loop 每个候选
        MS->>MS: score 六维(20/30/20/15/10/5) 或 其他类分支
        MS-->>PS: total >= 80 ? 生成 MatchRecord
    end
    PS->>AU: write_audit("publish_lost"/"publish_found")
    PS-->>FE: {item, suspected_matches}
    Note over U,FE: 认领 交接(双端扫码；IM 轮询非 WebSocket)
    U->>API: POST /matches/{id}/claim(claim_reason 必填)
    API->>MR: 状态 认领中；审计 claim
    U->>API: POST /matches/{id}/handover/generate
    API->>HO: 生成 6 位动态交接码(Redis可选/DB镜像)
    U->>API: POST /matches/{id}/handover/verify(双端)
    HO-->>MR: 双方验证通过 状态 已解决
    Note over U,FE: IM 沟通 前端每 4s 轮询 /im 会话(非 WebSocket)
